            <Box style={{ width: 72, height: 4, background: '#276FBF' }} />
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#546779', lineHeight: 1.7, width: 380 }}>先锁定输入与身份，再学会读状态和窗口，然后看页面上能取到什么证据，最后把调用与费用算清楚。</Text>
            <Box style={{ width: 380, height: 96, background: '#FFF4E6', borderRadius: 10, padding: '12px 16px', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 4, justifyContent: 'center', marginTop: 6 }}>
